					<p>
						<strong>(1) DRAMA on BBC Radio 3: Jubilee! (Live & First Broadcast!) </strong><br /><br />
						<strong>
							Sun 16th Jun 2024, at 20:00, on BBC Radio 3
						</strong><br /><br />
						Starring Samuel West, Sophia Nomvete, Kerry Shale, Lorelei King, Tayla Kovacevic-Ebong, Richard Clifford and Simon Callow.<br /><br />
						Written by: Garth Bardsley and Ray Shell<br />
						Directed by: Andy Jordan<br />
						Made for BBC Radio 3 Drama
					</p>
					<p>
						"As the dust settles on the American Civil War, a group of young black university students begin an extraordinary journey. Made In Manchester's 90-minute BBC Radio Drama, Jubilee! tells the story of the Fisk Jubilee Singers, a choir peopled entirely from once enslaved young men and women and founded to raise money for their beleaguered university. These young musicians would go on to captivate America and Europe, perform before presidents and royalty and become international celebrities. Uniquely, the choir introduced Spirituals to the world – secret songs once sung on blood-soaked plantations across the South – songs that began the march to freedom."
					</p>
					<p>
						More information: <br />
						- Link #1: <a href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/m00202zc" target="_blank">https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/m00202zc</a><br />
						- Link #2: <a href="https://genome.ch.bbc.co.uk/m00202zc" target="_blank">https://genome.ch.bbc.co.uk/m00202zc</a>
					</p>
				</div>
